# C++ style for src/ImageOptimizer.ShellMenu, checked by Super-Linter. Matches .editorconfig's 2-space indent.
BasedOnStyle: Microsoft
IndentWidth: 2
ColumnLimit: 120
NamespaceIndentation: All
AllowShortFunctionsOnASingleLine: Inline
SortIncludes: Never
DerivePointerAlignment: false
PointerAlignment: Left
StatementMacros: [CoCreatableClass]
